These are verbatim upstream files at the commit above, taken from the git blob
(LF), not from a working tree. They are build inputs only: `node deltas/build.mjs`
reads them together with the ops in deltas/manifest.json and regenerates the
overlay files under skills/.

To bump the snapshot by hand:
  1. copy the new version of each path below from the upstream commit:
       git -C <upstream-clone> show <new-commit>:skills/engineering/wayfinder/SKILL.md
       git -C <upstream-clone> show <new-commit>:skills/engineering/setup-matt-pocock-skills/SKILL.md
       git -C <upstream-clone> show <new-commit>:skills/engineering/setup-matt-pocock-skills/triage-labels.md
       git -C <upstream-clone> show <new-commit>:skills/engineering/setup-matt-pocock-skills/issue-tracker-local.md
  2. update commit/fetched above
  3. run `node deltas/build.mjs`; every op that can no longer find its exact
     upstream text fails loudly and names the op to fix
  4. review `git diff -- skills/` before committing
